    "media:imagetext": "San Francisco, Cal12omia.\n1927.\nCity and County o2 San Francisco,\nCity Hall,\nSan Francisco.\nAttention:\nAirport Conmittee of the Board\nGentLemen:\nOF Su0e2vis02s.\nPermission is hereby given to you by the undersigned\norners and lessees of Varney field, in San Mateo County,\nCalifornia, to construet and maintain upon the said field a\nmeteorologieal station with access thereto from the county zoad\ntor a period or one year, trom July 1, 1927, to June 30g\n1928,\nwith the further privilege of constructing the said station\nİmmediately.\nIt is hereby understood and agreed that the said station\nshall be located at a point approximately 108 feet northwesterly\nof the westerly corner of the hangar now constructed on the said\n11eld, as per maps submitted by you, marked 11le I-7770 and Ille\n4-7752•\nIt is further hereby understood and sgreed that in the\nevent of the sale of this property that this permission may be\nwithdraw on thirty days' notice.\nIt is further hereby understood and agreed that the City\nshall have the right to remove the building and instruments when\nit vacates the said premises.\n-\nOWNERS\n-\n-\nLESSINS\na50.0-0, 810, 0005.",
